      "message": "Ok so fetchCacheJSON does not work for POST requests\n\nUpdate the comment in `fetchPromisesCache \u003d new FetchPromisesCache` to specify this?\n\nWe should still cache this at the REST API layer creating a new `PostRequestsCache`.\n\nThen we solve the problem for all caches.\n\nCurrently it only solves it for `fixPreviewCache`",
